            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Breath? (anima, animae.) Memory? (memoria, memoriae.) Wisdom? (sapientia, sapientiae.) Talent? (ingenium, ingeniī.) A habit? (cōnsuētūdō, cōnsuētūdinis.) A generation? (saeculum, saeculī.) Age? (aetās, aetātis.) Sunset; a setting? (occāsus, occāsūs.) Sunrise; a rising? (ortus, ortūs.) First light? (dīlūculum, dīlūculī.) Finally? (dēnique.) Lastly? (postrēmō.) On the spot? (illicō.) Formerly? (quondam.) Long since? (iamdūdum.) A region? (regiō, regiōnis.) A province? (prōvincia, prōvinciae.) From there; then? (inde.) In the way? (obviam.) All the way? (usque.)"
